# BEAT FX on the touch screen. Copy to /opt/xdjaz/bfx.zones (then restart xdjaz) once the
# numbers fit your panel. Coordinates are screen pixels (1024x600 on the 7" panel).
#
# Measure them: set AZ_TOUCH_DEBUG=1 in local.conf, restart, open the BEAT FX panel and tap
# each element; `grep "touch at" /opt/xdjaz/touch/aztouch.log | tail` lists where each
# tap landed.
#
# A touch that comes down in a zone never reaches the player (it is the zone's alone),
# so draw them only over the BEAT FX panel.
#
#   B x0 y0 x1 y1 COMMAND     on    the BEAT FX ON/OFF button
#                             next  the next effect          prev  the previous one
#                             beat+ the next beat (BEAT >)   beat- the previous (BEAT <)
#                             type=N a given effect, N 0..13 (DELAY 0 ... MOBIUS 13)
#   X x0 y0 x1 y1 [v]         the X-PAD: the finger's position along the zone is sent
#                             as 0..255 while it touches (v: vertical, bottom 0, top 255)
#
# Examples (replace the numbers):
# B 700 120 800 170 on
# B 600 120 690 170 prev
# B 810 120 900 170 next
# B 600 260 690 310 beat-
# B 810 260 900 310 beat+
# X 600 360 900 420
